  "description": "In-Suh, Yeon-Ho, and Da-El, were always together during their school days. In-Suh, who injured his hand in an accident, gives up his dream of becoming a pianist and goes into hiding, but Yeon-Ho suddenly appears in front of In-suh. In-Suh pushes Yeon-Ho away because he is compared to him, but somehow he continues to be swayed by Yeon-Ho \n\n *\"I've hated you since high school, if it weren't for Da-El...\"\n\n\"Kim Da-El, who you were desperate for, is getting married to another woman.\"* \n\nIn-Suh suddenly hears the news of Da-El, whom he liked, is getting married. And...\n\n *\"...I endured it for 8 years-\"*\n\nI get to know Yeon-Ho's hidden feelings...\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)",
